[FE:ApprovalEngine] Applied proposal #12: Proposal applied (logged): [RECOMMENDATION_IMPROVEMENT] Deduplicate near-identical ad recommendations before scoring output — Add a pre-recommendation deduplication step that groups ads by creative hash, copy similarity, and asset lineage, then applies one representative prediction per cluster unless meaningful differences exist. For each cluster, preserve the best candidate and mark alternates as variants. This should also remove repeated scoring artifacts from dashboards and downstream recommendation lists.
