[FE:ApprovalEngine] Approving proposal #9: "Cap and calibrate extreme D7 ROAS predictions on Meta" (risk: low)
[FE:ApprovalEngine] Applying proposal #9: [SCORING_FORMULA_UPDATE] Cap and calibrate extreme D7 ROAS predictions on Meta
[FE:ApprovalEngine] Applied proposal #9: Proposal applied (logged): [SCORING_FORMULA_UPDATE] Cap and calibrate extreme D7 ROAS predictions on Meta — Add a post-model calibration layer for Meta predicted_roas_d7 that compresses extreme outputs above the 90th percentile of historically realized D7 ROAS. Implement this as a reversible mapping: (1) fit isotonic regression or percentile-based calibration on ads with matured D7 actuals, (2) apply a soft cap for predictions above a configurable threshold such as 12.0 ROAS, and (3) store both raw_score and calibrated_score so rollback is immediate. Start with Meta only and evaluate on the next 2 weekly cohorts before broader rollout.
