[FE:ApprovalEngine] Applied proposal #4: Proposal applied (logged): [NEW_SIGNAL] Add prediction maturity gating and label freshness signal — Create a new signal set that explicitly tracks whether an ad has a matured D7 outcome available, plus days-since-creation and days-until-maturity. Use this signal to suppress accuracy learning and recommendation confidence for non-matured ads. In the UI and recommendation engine, mark predictions from non-matured ads as provisional and reduce their influence on creative archetype performance summaries by 70% until the actual D7 value is available. Persist fields: has_actual_d7, age_in_days, maturity_bucket, provisional_confidence.
